# Repository Context Loading

Context loading is **not optional** — it is the first step before any work in this repository.

## Before ANY changes

Read in order:

1. `CONTEXT.md`
2. `AGENTS.md`
3. `docs/GOVERNANCE.md`
4. `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`
5. `docs/TESTING.md`
6. `docs/SECURITY.md`
7. `docs/CI_CD.md`

## MUST

- [ ] Read `CONTEXT.md` first
- [ ] Follow source-of-truth precedence
- [ ] Run `make preflight` before commit/push requests
- [ ] Escalate CF/IAM/workflow/security/governance changes for human review

## MUST NOT

- [ ] Skip governance because the task “seems small”
- [ ] Commit secrets or weaken coverage/CI gates without human approval
- [ ] Add network/SDK usage to the Edge handler without human approval
